      "claim": "[18F]FNDP, a benzylamide PET tracer, exhibited high and rapid brain uptake in baboons, supporting good CNS penetration for benzylamide-like molecules.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C11"],
      "claim": "Penicillin G shows poor CSF penetration due to rapid outward transport and its carboxylic acid/beta-lactam liabilities, which are not present in the query; this contradictory evidence is therefore less transferable.",
      "evidence_role": "contradictory"
    }
  ],
